## Commerce-API
### 결제 요청
POST localhost:8080/api/v1/payments
X-Loopers-LoginId: user1
X-Loopers-LoginPw: password1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": 1,
  "cardType": "SAMSUNG",
  "cardNo": "1234-5678-9814-1451"
}

