## PG-Simulator
### 결제 요청
POST localhost:8082/api/v1/payments
X-USER-ID:
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": "1351039135",
  "cardType": "SAMSUNG",
  "cardNo": "1234-5678-9814-1451",
  "amount" : "5000",
  "callbackUrl": "http://localhost:8080/api/v1/examples/callback"
}

### 결제 정보 확인
GET localhost:8082/api/v1/payments/20250816:TR:9577c5
X-USER-ID:

### 주문에 엮인 결제 정보 조회
GET localhost:8082/api/v1/payments?orderId=1351039135
